{
    "comment": "공통정보 삭제 확인 창. 지울 대상은 여는 쪽이 `_global.deleteModal` 에 담아 준 이름·id 두 값이다.\n  파란 안내가 이 창의 요점이다 — 공통정보는 여러 상품이 함께 참조하므로 지우면 그 상품들에서도\n  사라진다. 그래서 되돌릴 수 없다는 경고를 따로 한 줄 더 둔다.\n  삭제 후 선택을 비우고 보기 모드로 되돌린다 — 지운 항목이 선택된 채 남으면 빈 상세가 뜬다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Common Info Delete Confirm Modal"
    },
    "id": "delete_confirm_modal",
    "type": "composite",
    "name": "Modal",
    "props": {
        "title": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.common_info.modal.delete.title",
        "size": "sm",
        "titlePrefix": [
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Div",
                "props": {
                    "className": "ecommerce:w-6 ecommerce:h-6 ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:justify-center ecommerce:text-center"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Icon",
                        "props": {
                            "name": "exclamation",
                            "className": "ecommerce:text-base ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400 ecommerce:block"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "P",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce-text-body ecommerce:mb-3"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:font-semibold"
                    },
                    "text": "'{{_global.deleteModal.itemName}}'"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "text": " $t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.common_info.modal.delete.confirm_suffix"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce:p-3 ecommerce:bg-blue-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-900/20 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:mb-3"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-start ecommerce:gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "box",
                                "className": "ecommerce:text-base ecommerce:text-blue-600 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-400 ecommerce:flex-shrink-0 ecommerce:mt-0.5"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-tone-info-soft ecommerce:text-xs"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.common_info.modal.delete.warning"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "P",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.common_info.modal.delete.irreversible"
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce-modal-footer-buttons"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "closeModal"
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce-text-body ecommerce:border ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                        "disabled": "{{_global.isDeleting}}"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.common_info.button.cancel"
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Button",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "comment": "삭제 실행. 성공 갈래가 선택을 비우고 보기 모드로 되돌린 뒤 목록을 다시 부른다 — 지운 항목이 선택된 채 남으면 빈 상세가 그려진다.",
                            "type": "click",
                            "handler": "sequence",
                            "actions": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "isDeleting": true
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "apiCall",
                                    "target": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/product-common-infos/{{_global.deleteModal.itemId}}",
                                    "auth_required": true,
                                    "params": {
                                        "method": "DELETE"
                                    },
                                    "onSuccess": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "isDeleting": false,
                                                "selectedId": null,
                                                "selectedItem": null,
                                                "panelMode": "view"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "refetchDataSource",
                                            "params": {
                                                "dataSourceId": "commonInfos"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "success",
                                                "message": "{{response.message}}"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "closeModal"
                                        }
                                    ],
                                    "onError": [
                                        {
                                            "handler": "setState",
                                            "params": {
                                                "target": "global",
                                                "isDeleting": false
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "handler": "toast",
                                            "params": {
                                                "type": "error",
                                                "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ],
                    "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "ecommerce-flex-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:px-4 ecommerce:py-2 ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:hover:bg-red-700 ecommerce:dark:hover:bg-red-700 ecommerce:disabled:opacity-50 ecommerce:disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                        "disabled": "{{_global.isDeleting}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "if": "{{_global.isDeleting}}",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "spinner",
                                "className": "ecommerce-spinner-sm"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "text": "{{_global.isDeleting ? '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.common.deleting' : '$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.common_info.button.delete'}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
